stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Queued" as queued
    state "Processing" as processing
    state "Retrying" as retrying
    state "Dead letter" as deadLetter
    state "Succeeded" as succeeded
    [*] --> queued : enqueue / initial transition
    queued --> processing : claim [available] / lease, attempts++
    retrying --> processing : claim [available] / renew lease, attempts++
    processing --> succeeded : commitSucceeded / persist result + outbox
    processing --> retrying : processingFailed [retryable, budget remains] / delay
    processing --> deadLetter : processingFailed [permanent or budget exhausted] / retain error
    processing --> retrying : leaseExpired / recover
    deadLetter --> queued : redrive [authorized, eligible] / reset attempts
    succeeded --> [*]

    note right of deadLetter
        Redrive is refused for succeeded jobs,
        immutable-payload conflicts, partial results,
        or ineligible permanent failures.
    end note
